OL,3,AMiami runway incident disrupts flights
OL,4,Aon Thanksgiving eve
OL,5,
OL,6,FThanksgiving travellers in the US have
OL,7,Frun into disruption after an incident
OL,8,Fat one of the nation's busiest airports
OL,9,Fcaused hours-long delays.
OL,11,FOn Wednesday, the eve of the holiday,
OL,12,Fthe Federal Aviation Administration
OL,13,F(FAA) briefly grounded all flights
OL,14,Fheading for Miami International
OL,15,FAirport, after a FedEx aircraft overran
OL,16,Fone of the runways.
OL,18,FNo injuries were reported, and the FAA
OL,19,Fis investigating what happened.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
