OL,3,AMiami runway incident disrupts flights
OL,4,Aon Thanksgiving eve
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt had previously warned that delays
OL,7,Facross the country would be possible
OL,8,F"throughout the week" as a result of
OL,9,Fsevere weather, including heavy rain
OL,10,Fand wind that are forecast in eastern
OL,11,Fareas on Thursday.
